---
// ProblemFricciones.astro — Tres tarjetas del problema en hora punta
---

<div class="friction-col" role="list">
  <article class="friction-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
    <div class="card-info">
      <div class="icon-circle icon-warehouse" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3 class="card-heading">Un formulario por DeCA.</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Cuarenta cargas son cuarenta formularios.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="friction-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
    <div class="card-info">
      <div class="icon-circle icon-amber" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
          <path d="M6 12h12"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3 class="card-heading">La matrícula, repetida.</h3>
        <p class="card-text">La misma, en cada albarán del mismo camión.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="friction-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
    <div class="card-info">
      <div class="icon-circle icon-document" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
          <polyline points="12 7 12 12 15 15"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3 class="card-heading">El camión esperando.</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Sin DeCA no sale, y el conductor necesita su copia antes de arrancar.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .friction-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .friction-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface, var(--palette-white));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out), box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .friction-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 10px 20px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }
  }

  .card-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .icon-warehouse {
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-100);
    color: var(--palette-emerald-700);
  }

  .icon-amber {
    background-color: var(--palette-amber-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-amber-200);
    color: var(--palette-amber-700);
  }

  .icon-document {
    background-color: var(--palette-slate-100);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-200);
    color: var(--palette-slate-700);
  }

  .card-copy {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .card-heading {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .friction-card {
      transition: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
